{"title":"Blasting powder/5","sourceTitle":"Blasting powder/5/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Saltpeter\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Saltpeter\">Saltpeter</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Saltpeter\" title=\"Saltpeter\"> </a></span> pode ser encontrado em sistemas de cavernas e também pode ser adquirido no <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Trading#Commodities\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Trading\">commodities trader</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Trading#Commodities\" title=\"Trading\"> </a></span>. <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Sulfur\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Sulfur\">Sulfur</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Sulfur\" title=\"Sulfur\"> </a></span> só pode ser encontrado no subsolo <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Ore_Deposits#Shallow_ores\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Ore Deposits\">deposits</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Ore_Deposits#Shallow_ores\" title=\"Ore Deposits\"> </a></span>. <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Coal\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Coal\">Black coal</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Coal\" title=\"Coal\"> </a></span> pode ser encontrado em depósitos subterrâneos, e tem chance de aparecer em <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Cracked_vessel#Ore\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Cracked vessel\">cracked vessels (ore)</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Cracked_vessel#Ore\" title=\"Cracked vessel\"> </a></span>.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261111115821\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.004 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.004 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 127/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1076/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 468/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,m